              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=10452"
            },
            "displayName": "Peeter Piegaze",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "Etc/UTC"
          },
          "body": "Ok, as per offline discussion, inheritance rules affect behavior of node type discovery methods, therefore inhgeritance rules belong in the spec.",
